INTERPRETATION
  The residue-count and affine-pair quotients see every full-residue k=8 shape
  as the same object: one duplicated residue and all seven residues present.
  Even affine triple/quad residue profiles remain far coarser than the integer
  gap word.  Thus the affine CJJ route must retain generated gap-word or
  relation-code marginal data after quotienting; residue-only affine moments
  cannot be the final proof certificate.

