PROOF OBLIGATION PROPOSED
  P0: use HYP-2749 to discard non-full residue shapes.
  P1: normalize the remaining shapes by translation+dilation, but retain the
      integer gap/generated-word data rather than only residues.
  P2: prove AP maximizes the level-2 relation-code pair-marginal bound on this
      affine-normalized full-residue quotient.
  P3: splice that extremality into the signed THM-534 Delsarte dual; use the
      theta-prime/tournament bridge as a ceiling comparison, not as a proof by
      itself.
